# FBX-ONLY CHARACTER PACKS. The deliberate exception, and the only place .fbx
# is accepted anywhere in this repository.
#
# ../characters/.gitignore excludes FBX on purpose: a pack that ships BOTH glTF
# and FBX carries the FBX as a pure duplicate, and .blend sources are often
# larger than every model combined. That rule is right, and it is why ten of the
# twenty Quaternius character packs arrived as nothing but a stray Preview.png —
# the 2017-2019 packs (Zombie, Robot, Enemy Pack, Fruit Characters, the Animated
# Men/Women sets, Posed Background Characters) predate Quaternius shipping glTF
# and have no other format to offer.
#
# So this folder exists for the packs that would otherwise be lost, and NOTHING
# ELSE. If a pack has a glTF folder, it belongs in ../characters/ — putting it
# here uploads the same characters twice, in the heavier format.
#
# tools/ingest-characters.mjs converts FBX and injects the texture beside it, or
# pulls a baked-in texture out of the FBX binary. That path is written and
# tested against synthetic input; it has never run on a real FBX, so the first
# pack through it gets checked model by model in a browser before anything
# reaches the forge.

# ignore everything...
*

# ...but descend into directories
!*/

# ...and keep FBX and the textures it references
!*.fbx
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg

!LICENSE*
!License*
!license*
!README.md
!.gitignore
